msgstr "儲存失敗：%s"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/honk/service.js:1034
msgid "Unchecked, honk runs without the native API and doona. Saving restarts honk."
msgstr "取消勾選後，honk 只運行核心，不啟用 native API 與 doona。儲存時會重新啟動 honk。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/honk/service.js:661
msgid "Up to date"
msgstr "已是最新版本"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/honk/service.js:672
