msgid "Upgrading %s restarts the service and interrupts connections for a few seconds; upgrading only the other packages reloads it. Continue?"
msgstr "升級 %s 會重新啟動服務，連線將中斷數秒；只升級其他套件則改為重新載入。是否繼續？"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/honk/service.js:697
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/honk/service.js:776
msgid "Upgrading…"
msgstr "正在升級…"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/honk/service.js:999
msgid "Version"
msgstr "版本"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/honk/service.js:817
